## The pages a person approves a device's sign-in on, by the code it shows.

device-title = Device sign-in
device-code = Code
device-continue = Continue
device-guard = Enter only a code shown on a device you are using
device-refused = Code not accepted
device-expired = Link expired · open it again on the device
device-spent = Too many tries · try again in { $minutes } min
device-failed = Failed · try again
device-unlinked = Open the link the device shows
device-done-title = Approved
device-done = Device approved · go back to it
